<Base title="About">
  <h1 class="sr-only" data-i18n="aboutTitle">About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p data-i18n="aboutLead">
      I help health systems and health-tech companies adopt AI and digital health technologies,
      and use clinical and operational data to find bottlenecks and turn analytics into decisions.
      I advise on AI/ML implementation, interoperability (OMOP, FHIR, HL7), and putting new tools
      to work in clinical settings.
    </p>
    <p data-i18n="aboutColumbia">
      At Columbia University Medical Center, I developed an AI teaching assistant for nursing
      students and architected a hybrid computational infrastructure that supports researchers’
      computational work, including work with large language models.
    </p>
    <p data-i18n="aboutPast">
      In previous lives I was a nurse, a business partner in a home care delivery clinic, and later
      worked at a university medical center during the Covid pandemic.
    </p>
    <p data-i18n="aboutEducation">
      I hold a Master of Management in Clinical Informatics from Duke University School of
      Medicine, with a certificate in Innovation and Entrepreneurship, and a Bachelor of Nursing
      from the University of Verona.
    </p>
    <p data-i18n="aboutPersonal">
      I’m Italian, and outside of work I love football, books, and jazz. I’m also a geek for
      ancient Japanese and Korean architecture, a passion that comes from my technical high school
      diploma in civil engineering technology and architecture.
    </p>

    <h2 data-i18n="stackTitle">Stack</h2>
    <p data-i18n-html="stackInformatics">
      <strong>Informatics &amp; AI/ML:</strong> NLP/LLM systems, predictive modeling, RAG architecture,
      clinical analytics, EHR data (Epic Clarity), FHIR/HL7, OMOP CDM.
    </p>
    <p data-i18n-html="stackData">
      <strong>Data:</strong> SQL, MySQL, BigQuery, Dataform, Dataplex, Looker Studio.
    </p>
    <p data-i18n-html="stackEngineering">
      <strong>Engineering:</strong> Python, PyTorch, TensorFlow, Hugging Face, LangChain, Docker, GitHub.
    </p>
    <p data-i18n-html="stackCloud">
      <strong>Cloud/Product:</strong> AWS, Azure, Google Cloud, Jira, Figma.
    </p>
